# Civilization VI (strategy, mouse): A clicks, B is Esc, the D-pad zooms, a long press steps forward.
setup packs/civilization-6.padpack Civilization VI
model xbox360
tap south 40
tap east 40
tap dpad-up 40
tap dpad-down 40
press dpad-left
advance 600
release dpad-left
advance 300
---
mouse Left down        @0
mouse Left up          @40
key KEY_ESC down       @40
key KEY_ESC up         @80
wheel 120 0            @80
wheel -120 0           @120
key KEY_LEFTBRACE down @660
key KEY_LEFTBRACE up   @760
